[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Consequently the library has:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * **0** error-return macros (`RETURN_ERROR`, `return -1`, `return NULL`, …)
